{
 "_doc": "Plants area (rust/tests/parity/seed.d/20_plants.sql): /growatt/plants, /plants/{id}/inverters, /overview, /power, /growatt/sync/*. The engineer is assigned plants 42, 7, 1001 (run.sh) and 2001 (seed). The first cases assign 2001 to the engineer (cases.json leaves the engineer with 10, 30); the last puts 10, 30 back.",
